	(gr_text "JLC two-layer polyimide flex, 0.19 mm: 50 um PI core, 18 um copper, ENIG; yellow coverlay, 25 um PI + 25 um adhesive, both sides.\nThe bottom coverlay opens 2.5 mm from each tip over the fingers. No silkscreen.\nPI stiffener 0.225 mm on the top over each end, outline on User.1 Stiffener, 4.2 mm from each tip: 0.34 mm at the fingers.\nLaser outline +/-0.05 mm: tails 12.50 +/-0.05 mm wide for Hirose FH12-24S-0.5SVA(54), 0.5 mm pitch vertical.\nInstalled bent 180 degrees between the stiffeners, about 2.5 mm radius: keep the middle free of vias."
		(at 100 114.5 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "7445980b-8b38-4a1b-924f-cbeb6939c8a0")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
